title: Gas Lamp
text: Light the lamp. Its flame burns white, and the glass shows it only at the corners.
trick: the flame can only be seen through the lantern's corners; a yellow beam and a blue beam cross there to make white
motif: pictogram
expect: shared>=1
proof: not proved; no other solution found in 300 s
